title: Niko3
---
<<declare $playerName="player">>
<<gatherVars>>
Lunch time at last. The day was bright for once, so you chose a spot under a
tree for shade. As you pulled out your notes, you felt eyes on you.

You looked up quickly, but the campus was clear. Only a few groups lingered
nearby. No one seemed to be watching you.

Blaming it on yesterday, you returned to your work.

It was easy to get absorbed when focused. That must be why you didn't hear
the footsteps.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "How is it that everywhere I go you're there too?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

His gravelly voice brushed your ear. You jumped, scattering your notes.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Wow, you'd think I'd just said boo with your reaction."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He laughed softly, clearly amused.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "I mean c'mon, are you that obsessed you're following me now?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

-> Fluster
    <<incRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump FlusterN3>>
-> Accuse him
    <<decRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump AccuseN3>>
===

title: FlusterN3
---
You: "W-what?"

You gasped. Follow him? You weren't even sure if you liked him.

You: "I definitely didn't! Are you sure you didn't follow me?"

You cringed immediately after saying it.

<<jump Niko3Continue>>
===

title: AccuseN3
---
You: "Hey! When I came here, no one was around. I'm working on my essay, so
why would I seek someone out to interrupt myself?"

You pointed at him sharply.

You: "If I didn't know better, I'd say you followed me."

You glanced behind him. Only thick bushes stood beyond the tree.

He had approached from behind.

He had been watching you the entire time.

You: "You... didn't, right?"

You spoke quietly, oddly satisfied at the thought.

<<jump Niko3Continue>>
===

title: Niko3Continue
---
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Why would I follow you?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He sat beside you without asking.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "I come here to read on sunny days. You, however, have never sat here
before. So I conclude you're pursuing me."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

You: "Pursuing you?"

You echoed, alarmed.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "First you harass me for your essay, and now you stalk me."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Why... {$playerName}, do you have a crush on me?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

-> Confess
    <<incRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump ConfessNiko3>>
-> Deny
    <<decRelationship "Niko" 1>>
    <<jump DenyNiko3>>
===

title: ConfessNiko3
---
You: "Truthfully?"

You hesitated, almost asking permission.

He stared at you.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "I think you owe me the truth."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

You couldn't argue.

You: "There's a desire... something I can't explain. I didn't follow you,
but being near you is all I want."

Niko covered his face slightly.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "I hadn't expected you to be so honest. Are you that desperate?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "You don't know me. You don't know what I want."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

You: "I want to know you."

<<jump EndNiko3>>
===

title: DenyNiko3
---
You: "Have a crush on you?"

You scoffed.

You: "I'm not even sure I like you as a person."

His face fell slightly.

A sinking feeling grew in your chest.

You: "I'm sorry. Your attitude just rubs me the wrong way."

<<jump EndNiko3>>
===

title: EndNiko3
---
Niko seemed pleased, like he understood more than you said. After a pause,
he spoke again.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "You're not the worst company. How's your essay coming?"
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

The shift in tone caught you off guard.

You: "It's a struggle."

You admitted honestly.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Alright, hit me. Give me the next question."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He seemed unusually cooperative.

<<setBool NikoDiaImageState true>>
Niko: "Next question."
<<setBool NikoDiaImageState false>>

He demanded again, his tone shifting back.

You handed him the next question and took the completed one.
===